TI  - Simple schwannomatosis or an incomplete Coffin-Siris? Report of a particular case
PY  - 2019
T2  - eNeurologicalSci
VL  - 14
SP  - 31
EP  - 33
DO  - 10.1016/j.ensci.2018.11.021
