TI  - Splenic torsion of a wandering spleen and polysplenia syndrome in a 10-year-old boy with cyanotic congenital heart disease: A case report
PY  - 2026
T2  - Journal of Pediatric Surgery Case Reports
VL  - 133
C7  - 103340
