TI  - Pancreatic nodule positive for 68-Ga-DOTAPEPTIDE-PET: NET or ectopic spleen? The importance of a good differential diagnosis
PY  - 2020
T2  - Clinical and Translational Imaging
VL  - 8
IS  - 5
