TI  - Identification of splenic IRF7 as a nanotherapy target for tele-conditioning myocardial reperfusion injury
PY  - 2025
T2  - Nature Communications 
VL  - 16
IS  - 1
C7  - 1909
DO  - 10.1038/s41467-025-57048-6
UR  - https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85218491945?origin=resultslist
AD  - Department of Cardiovascular Surgery, Ruijin Hospital, Shanghai Jiao Tong University School of Medicine, Shanghai, China
AD  - Laboratory of Precision and Nanomedicine, Institute of Biomedicine and Translational Medicine, University of Tartu, Tartu, Estonia
AD  - Fujian Provincial Key Laboratory of Innovative Drug Target Research, School of Pharmaceutical Sciences, Xiamen University, Fujian, Xiamen, China
AD  - Department of Cardiovascular Medicine, Ruijin Hospital, Shanghai Jiao Tong University School of Medicine, Shanghai, China
