TI  - Rare causes of acute abdomen in a paediatric surgery department: a 5-years review
PY  - 2026
T2  - Clinica Terapeutica
VL  - 177
IS  - 1
SP  - 146
EP  - 152
DO  - 10.7417/CT.2026.1986
