TI  - 'Wandering spleen with acute torsion': a rare indication for splenectomy in an adult, complicated by postoperative splanchnic venous thrombosis and intestinal gangrene
PY  - 2021
T2  - BMJ Case Reports
VL  - 14
IS  - 2
C7  - e238647
DO  - 10.1136/bcr-2020-238647
