TI  - Recurrent splenic volvulus after splenopexy in an 11-year-old child: A case report
PY  - 2024
T2  - Journal of Pediatric Surgery Case Reports
VL  - 110
C7  - 102877
DO  - 10.1016/j.epsc.2024.102877
