TI  - Laparoscopic splenopexy for wandering spleen, a video demonstration of technique by encircling the spleen with polyglactin 910 woven mesh
PY  - 2017
T2  - Surgical Endoscopy
VL  - 31
IS  - 12
SP  - 5427
EP  - 5428
