TI  - The value of MR angiography in predicting the risk of torsion of a pelvic spleen during pregnancy
PY  - 2002
T2  - European Radiology
VL  - 12
IS  - 2
SP  - 309
EP  - 311
DO  - 10.1007/s003300100984
